---
import MRISliceViewer from "@/components/MRISliceViewer.jsx";

export const layout = "../../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
export const title = "What is an MRI?";
export const description = "Stylish MRI education page for USRad";
---

<section
  class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-white via-gray-50 to-gray-100 py-24 px-6 sm:px-12"
>
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto text-center">
    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">
      What Is an MRI?
    </h1>
    <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 mb-10">
      Magnetic Resonance Imaging lets us see inside the human body—without a
      single incision or any radiation.
    </p>
    <img
      src="/images/website/mri-hero-brain.webp"
      alt="Animated MRI brain scan"
      class="mx-auto rounded-xl shadow-xl max-w-3xl"
    />
    <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-gray-500 italic">
      Real anonymized MRI brain slices visualized for learning purposes
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="bg-white py-20 px-6 sm:px-12 border-t border-gray-200">
  <div
    class="max-w-6xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center"
  >
    <div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">How It Works</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-700 text-lg leading-relaxed">
        MRI uses a powerful magnet and radio waves to create detailed images of
        your organs and tissues. It’s completely non-invasive, and unlike X-rays
        or CT scans, it doesn't use radiation. Your body’s hydrogen atoms align
        with the magnetic field, and a computer turns the signal into
        cross-sectional images.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <img
        src="/images/website/mri-physics-diagram.svg"
        alt="MRI concept diagram"
        class="w-full rounded-xl shadow-lg"
      />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="bg-gray-50 py-20 px-6 sm:px-12">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-10">
      Real MRI Slice Viewer
    </h2>
    <p class="mb-8 text-gray-600">
      Scroll or drag to explore a real MRI brain scan—from top to bottom.
    </p>
    <div
      class="relative w-full max-w-lg mx-auto aspect-square bg-black rounded-xl shadow-xl"
    >
      <MRISliceViewer client:visible />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="bg-white py-20 px-6 sm:px-12 border-t border-gray-200">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-10 text-center">
      Common Reasons for an MRI
    </h2>
    <div
      class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 text-center"
    >
      <div>
        <div class="text-4xl mb-2">🧠</div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-medium">Brain & Nerves</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Headaches, stroke, MS, seizures</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="text-4xl mb-2">🦴</div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-medium">Spine & Joints</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">
          Back pain, disc herniation, sports injuries
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="text-4xl mb-2">🫀</div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-medium">Organs</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Liver, kidneys, heart, uterus</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="text-4xl mb-2">🦿</div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-medium">Muscles & Soft Tissue</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Tears, tumors, inflammation</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="bg-gray-900 text-white py-24 px-6 sm:px-12">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto text-center">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6">How Much Does an MRI Cost?</h2>
    <p class="text-lg mb-8">
      With USRad, most patients pay under <span
        class="text-green-300 font-semibold">$600</span
      >—a fraction of what hospitals charge.
    </p>
    <a
      href="/pricing"
      class="inline-block px-6 py-3 bg-green-500 hover:bg-green-600 text-white font-medium rounded-xl transition"
      >See Transparent Pricing</a
    >
  </div>
</section>

<section class="bg-white py-12 text-center text-sm text-gray-500">
  <p>
    Images and videos are for educational purposes only and do not replace
    medical consultation. © USRad 2025
  </p>
</section>
